{"kind":"finding","id":"F-ledger-career-010-01","file":"Source/Parsek.Tests/CareerStateWindowUITests.cs","line":421,"method":"Build_Milestones_IneffectiveDuplicateSkipped","category":"T1","severity":"Medium","confidence":"high","falsifiability":"falsifiability: Source/Parsek/UI/CareerStateWindowUI.cs:545; delete the milestone !a.Effective guard -> stays green (the UT=200 duplicate is caught by the AlreadyCredited arm at :551); delete both guards -> red","what_it_asserts":"A single milestone row survives an Effective=true FirstLaunch at UT=100 plus an Effective=false duplicate of the same id at UT=200, with CreditedUT pinned to 100.","why_weak":"The second action is also a duplicate, so the AlreadyCredited arm at :551 skips it whether or not the Effective arm the test names is present; neither guard is individually pinned and the pure ineffective-milestone case has no cell.","proposed_action":"Give the second action a fresh id (e.g. Milestone(\"GhostMilestone\", ut:200, effective:false)) so only the Effective arm can skip it; assert the row count stays 1 and CreditedUT stays 100.","effort":"S","july_ref":"none"}
{"kind":"finding","id":"F-ledger-career-010-02","file":"Source/Parsek.Tests/CareerStateWindowUITests.cs","line":440,"method":"Build_FacilityLevelsEchoed_ContractsUseMissionControl_StrategiesUseAdministration","category":"T1","severity":"Medium","confidence":"high","falsifiability":"falsifiability: Source/Parsek/UI/CareerStateWindowUI.cs:593,602; swap the MissionControl/Administration key lookups -> stays green because both fixture upgrades set level 2, so the asserted levels (2/2) and slot calls (GetContractSlots(2), GetStrategySlots(2)) are unchanged","what_it_asserts":"Contracts read MissionControl level/slots and Strategies read Administration level/slots after upgrading SpaceCenter/MissionControl and SpaceCenter/Administration.","why_weak":"The comment claims to guard a crossed Phase-1 revision, but both facilities end at the same level, so a crossed key read yields identical levels and identical slot arguments; the cell cannot fail for the reason it names.","proposed_action":"Upgrade the two facilities to different levels (MissionControl 2, Administration 3); a crossed read then changes the asserted levels and slot counts and the existing asserts go red.","effort":"S","july_ref":"none"}
{"kind":"coverage","sut":"CareerStateWindowUI","sut_file":"Source/Parsek/UI/CareerStateWindowUI.cs","sut_line":456,"case_kind":"state-transition","proposed_name":"Build_Contracts_FailAndCancelRemoveActive","sketch":"Accept ctr-a at UT 100 and ctr-b at UT 110, then Fail ctr-a and Cancel ctr-b at UT 200, liveUT 150: assert both CurrentRows present with IsClosingByTimelineEnd true and ProjectedRows empty.","guards":"The ContractFail/ContractCancel arm merged with ContractComplete (CareerStateWindowUI.cs:456-465); only Complete removal has a cell, so dropping Fail/Cancel keeps stale current rows with no red.","risk":"ui"}
